Spec: Windows owned application transport runtime

Purpose:
  Compose an approved application with a verified owned backend process while retaining device keys inside the Agent.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Runtime.csproj
  ./packages.lock.json
  ./README.md

References:
  /windows/LinkGate.Broker/RegistrationReview.sdd
  /windows/LinkGate.Processes/LinkGate.Processes.sdd

Must:
  Permit the dedicated local runtime verification assembly to inspect internal pool lifecycles without exposing them to business SDKs.
  Keep runtime ownership and network credentials out of thin business SDK dependencies.
  Start only explicitly selected source-built verified runtimes and leave installed legacy services unchanged.
